<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 17.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Southampton, Tewsbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Apr 114.50</p>
<p>Milling wheat 10 pct protein to Liverpool Apr/Jun 116.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Avon May 100.00/99.50 Jun 101.50/01.00 asa 99.00</p>
<p>East AngliaMay 101.00/00.50 Oct/Dec 103.50/03.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 99.50/99.00/98.50 asa 98.25</p>
<p>Feed barley to Avon Apr 100.00</p>
</text>
